Package: mtbls2mztabm
Title: MetaboLights Studies as SummarizedExperiment Objects and mzTab-M Files
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: person("Kozo", "Nishida", email = "knishida@riken.jp",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns the ISA-TAB files deposited with a MetaboLights study into
    Bioconductor objects and standard exchange files. Study factors, sample
    annotations and the metabolite assignment file of an assay are retrieved
    through the MsBackendMetaboLights package and assembled into a
    SummarizedExperiment whose layout matches the one produced by the xcms
    preprocessing workflow for MetaboLights data, so that both can be handled
    by the same downstream code. The main function takes a MetaboLights
    study identifier and writes an mzTab-M 2.1 file with the RmzTabM
    package, filling the metadata section from the ISA-TAB investigation and
    assay tables.
License: Artistic-2.0
